# CODEOWNERS — who must review changes to the highest-risk surfaces before they merge.
#
# This file is the enforcement the production deploy workflow already assumes: a SECOND reviewer on
# database migrations (deploy-production.yml names "the second migration reviewer") and on the deploy
# pipeline itself. GitHub auto-requests review from the owners below and, once branch protection has
# `require_code_owner_review: true`, BLOCKS merge until an owner approves the matching files.
#
# >>> BEFORE THIS WORKS, DO TWO THINGS (one-time):
# 1. Replace @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers with a REAL GitHub team in the techfleetworks org
#    (Org → Teams → New team), or list individual @handles. A team/handle that does not exist is
#    silently ignored — no review is requested — so confirm it resolves on a test PR.
# 2. Turn on code-owner review: set "require_code_owner_review": true in
#    .github/rulesets/main-protection.json and re-apply it with scripts/apply-ruleset.sh.
#    See docs/setup/multi-dev-deploy.md §2.
#
# Owners need write access to the repo. The last matching pattern wins, so order matters.

# Default: any change gets a maintainer's eyes.
*                               @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers

# Database migrations — a bad migration is the hardest thing to undo. Two-person review (release-
# deployment-safety: expand/contract, never destructive in the expand phase).
/supabase/migrations/**         @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers
/supabase/config.toml           @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers
/data-map.json                  @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers

# The deploy pipeline and what runs in CI — a change here can ship anything, so it is maintainer-owned.
/.github/workflows/**           @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers
/.github/rulesets/**            @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers

# Standing architectural rules and the gate config — changing these changes what "done" means.
/decisions.md                   @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers
/arch-gate.config.json          @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers
/arch-gate.waivers.json         @techfleetworks/trackpoli-maintainers
